  "description": "Clockworks is a .NET library for deterministic, fully controllable time in distributed-system simulations and tests. It provides a simulated TimeProvider with deterministic timer scheduling, TimeProvider-driven timeouts, UUIDv7 generation, and Hybrid Logical Clock (HLC) utilities with lightweight instrumentation.",
